   "source": [
    "# Task 3: Telco Customer Churn \u2014 Ensemble Classification\n",
    "\n",
    "Predict customer churn from telecom subscription records and compare a\n",
    "**Random Forest** against **XGBoost**, targeting a **ROC-AUC above 0.80**.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Workflow\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Load and profile the dataset\n",
    "2. Coerce `TotalCharges` to numeric and handle the nulls\n",
    "3. Explore the churn signal across categorical and numeric features\n",
    "4. Encode categorical features with `OneHotEncoder` and split the data\n",
    "5. Diagnose the class imbalance\n",
    "6. Compare three balancing strategies: none, class weighting, and SMOTE\n",
    "7. Tune and cross-validate both classifiers with `GridSearchCV`\n",
    "8. Plot ROC curves, confusion matrices, and feature importances\n",
    "9. Save figures, metrics, and fitted models\n",
    "\n",
    "### Expected Deliverable\n",
    "\n",
    "A Jupyter notebook with a ROC curve, a confusion matrix, and a feature\n",
    "importance bar chart.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 0. Setup\n",
    "\n",
    "Imports, paths, and configuration used throughout the notebook."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
