  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Clean the Data\n",
    "\n",
    "Three things need fixing before any modelling:\n",
    "\n",
    "- `customerID` is an identifier with no predictive value.\n",
    "- `TotalCharges` is stored as **text** and contains blank strings, which become\n",
    "  nulls once coerced to numeric.\n",
    "- `Churn` is text (`Yes` / `No`) and needs to be binary.\n",
    "\n",
    "The 11 blank `TotalCharges` rows are not random: every one belongs to a customer\n",
    "with `tenure == 0`, meaning they signed up but have not been billed yet. Filling\n",
    "those with **0.0** is more defensible than the column median (1,397.48), which\n",
    "would invent charges these customers never had."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "df = df.drop(columns=[ID_COLUMN])\n",
    "\n",
    "blank_before = int((df[\"TotalCharges\"].astype(str).str.strip() == \"\").sum())\n",
    "df[\"TotalCharges\"] = pd.to_numeric(df[\"TotalCharges\"], errors=\"coerce\")\n",
    "nulls_after_coercion = int(df[\"TotalCharges\"].isnull().sum())\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Blank TotalCharges strings : {blank_before}\")\n",
    "print(f\"NaN after numeric coercion: {nulls_after_coercion}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "blank_tenure = df.loc[df[\"TotalCharges\"].isnull(), \"tenure\"]\n",
    "print(\"\\ntenure values of the rows with blank TotalCharges:\", sorted(blank_tenure.unique().tolist()))\n",
    "print(\"all of them have tenure == 0:\", bool((blank_tenure == 0).all()))\n",
    "\n",
    "# New customers have not been billed yet -> 0.0, not the median.\n",
    "df.loc[df[\"TotalCharges\"].isnull() & (df[\"tenure\"] == 0), \"TotalCharges\"] = 0.0\n",
    "\n",
    "remaining = int(df[\"TotalCharges\"].isnull().sum())\n",
    "if remaining:\n",
    "    median = float(df[\"TotalCharges\"].median())\n",
    "    df[\"TotalCharges\"] = df[\"TotalCharges\"].fillna(median)\n",
    "    print(f\"\\nFilled {remaining} remaining null(s) with the median ({median:.2f})\")\n",
    "\n",
    "df[TARGET] = (df[TARGET] == \"Yes\").astype(int)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\nTotalCharges dtype:\", df[\"TotalCharges\"].dtype)\n",
    "print(\"TotalCharges describe:\")\n",
    "print(df[\"TotalCharges\"].describe().round(2).to_string())\n",
    "print(\"\\nMissing values after cleaning:\", int(df.isnull().sum().sum()))\n",
    "print(\"Churn encoding:\", {int(k): int(v) for k, v in df[TARGET].value_counts().sort_index().items()})"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Exploratory Analysis"
